      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "密码组集合！"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "“嘿！你们听我说！137121111,135120110,142126115,156139126,152135123,159141128！”挥舞着纸张的研究员像是发现了新大陆的藏宝图，他围着所有人转了个圈，在确认人数的同时让纸张从所有人面前飘过。\n“151134122,167148135,186166150,203181163,180161145,163145132！”\n“你在说什么？”\n“166148134,208185168,221197177,197176158,155138126,141125114！”\n“听着像是RGB值？”\n“203180163,185165149,175156141,164146132,136122111,138124113！”\n“你被约翰·提托感染了？说人话，不然我们可走了。”\n“这堆纸上的乱码里可能画着一张藏宝图！你们得帮我破解它，乌尔里希呢？”\n“它现在应该在排队买去澳大利亚的船票，暂时不会回来了。这个你是在哪儿搞到的？”\n“计算机室门外的纸箱上有一堆打点卡，我把它们都扔进了解读器里。”\n“行了，别费力气了，你拿着的大概是乌尔里希扔掉的草稿纸。”"
        }
      ],
      "link_source": "supplement_episode_id"
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1082402,
      "owner_episode_id": 10824,
      "trigger_episode_id": null,
      "title": "往日的分径-洛佩拉",
      "description": "",
      "action": "往日的分径",
      "unlock_condition": "EpisodeFinish=10824",
      "content_hints": [
        "fragment"
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "它的主人暂未想出更为高明的取胜方式。但，至少它有效提供了诡计成功时的窃喜情绪。"
        }
      ],
      "link_source": "supplement_episode_id"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "script_id": "100837",
      "internal_title": "第八章8-24",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "独角戏"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "她捡起枪，捡起子弹，一一填入弹巢。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "一，二，三。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "这儿没有敌人，没有目标，也没有对手。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "她从没有如此茫然地举起过枪。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "如同置身荒原的猎人，她无处可去，也无家可归。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "特效"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "中靶。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "三颗子弹，留下标靶上的一个孔洞。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "一，二，三。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "消人"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "特效"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "弹壳退下，子弹装填。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "一，二，三。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "消人"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "特效"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "客房"
        },
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "基金会客房"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "地标"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "枪声"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一个“千疮百孔”的房间。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一位手指麻木的少女，机械性地扣动扳机。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "枪管没有反应。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "黑屏"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "谎言。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "欺瞒。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "背叛。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "她松开手，左轮枪落到脚边。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "从一开始你们就把我支走，对吗？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "一个没有将她纳入谋划的谋划。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "还是说，从一开始你们就没有相信过我。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "这只是一场过家家吗，姐姐？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "客房"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "“猎人”丢下枪，看着眼前没有边际的旷野。这儿只有风，吹过无花果树的风。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "氛围图"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "她靠上墙壁，抱紧自己。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "洛佩拉",
          "text": "为什么……"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "渐黑"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "同一个岔口。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "暖阳变寒冷。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "树叶垂落，一个吻。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "烈火无法。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "将过去化为尘埃。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "直到现在。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "在忧郁的热带，我们道别。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "我望着你眼中低语。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "在忧郁的热带，我们吻别。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "天使娜娜",
          "text": "而你将与一生所爱相遇。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "视频结束"
        },
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "THE END"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fallback_fields": []
}